{
  "site": {
    "name": "Atelier Morane",
    "baseline": {
      "$t": {
        "fr": "Architecture en territoire de pente, entre Arve et Giffre.",
        "en": "Architecture on sloping ground, between the Arve and the Giffre."
      }
    },
    "about": {
      "$t": {
        "fr": [
          [
            {
              "text": "L’atelier construit peu, et "
            },
            {
              "text": "toujours en montagne",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ". Chaque projet part du terrain : sa pente, son eau, ce que l’hiver en fait. Nous dessinons des bâtiments compacts, en bois et en pierre du pays, pensés pour être entretenus par ceux qui les habitent."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "Fondé en 2014 à Sallanches, l’atelier réunit quatre architectes et travaille avec les mêmes charpentiers depuis ses débuts."
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "text": "The studio builds little, and "
            },
            {
              "text": "always in the mountains",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ". Each project starts from the ground: its slope, its water, what winter does to it. We draw compact buildings in local timber and stone, meant to be looked after by the people who live in them."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "Founded in 2014 in Sallanches, the studio brings together four architects and has worked with the same carpenters since its first day."
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    "portrait": {
      "id": "a_seed001",
      "path": "/media/a_seed001/atelier.jpg",
      "name": "atelier.jpg",
